msgstr "<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#555;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:6px;\">Control UI 浏览器连接时触发了安全配对策略，您可直接在此一键批准，无需在下方终端中手动查找与输入 Request ID。</div>"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/openclaw/advanced.js:53
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/openclaw/console.js:69
